            "review_title": "Review at Boat Noodle Bangkok - Aeon Mall Tan Phu",
            "review_text": "Cẩm H\n1 contribution\n0\nA great place for anyone who loves authentic Thai food and wants a quick, tasty meal\nOct 2025 • Couples\nI recently had lunch at Boat Noodle in Aeon Mall Tân Phú, and it was an enjoyable experience. The restaurant has a cozy, Thai-style atmosphere with friendly staff. The noodles were flavorful, especially the beef boat noodles — rich broth and tender meat. The portions are small, but the prices are reasonable, so you can try many dishes. Overall, it’s a great place for anyone who loves authentic Thai food and wants a quick, tasty meal.\nRead more\nWritten October 9, 2025",
