            "review_text": "Ngọc Thư\nBinh Dinh Province, Vietnam1 contribution\n0\nThe recent trip of my family felt very ok because we found a Thai noodle shop that really suited our family's taste\nOct 2025 • Family\nThe food here is delicious, suitable for my family's taste. I am very satisfied with the service of the staff, they are very cute, enthusiastic and thoughtful in advising customers on dishes. The space here is airy and spacious, making the food very delicious. My family ate and praised the spicy volcanic ribs and tomyum noodles because the broth is very rich, especially the color of the tomyum noodle broth, it was eye-catching to me. I will introduce it to my friends and come to this place to eat because my friend also really likes Thai food. Besides, I saw that the new boat has a tomyum hot pot dish that is also very eye-catching to me and my family will come back to enjoy the new dish here ❤️\nRead more\nWritten October 8, 2025",
